&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yongmei Huang, MD, DrPH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Assistant Professor of Reproductive Sciences (in Obstetrics and Gynecology)&amp;nbsp;at the Columbia University Medical Center&lt;br /&gt;
